          "Centro de Investigaciones Químicas, Universidad Autónoma del Estado de Morelos, Cuernavaca, Mexico.",
          "Peptides International, Louisville, KY 40299, USA.",
          "Medicinal Chemistry, Monash Institute of Pharmaceutical Sciences, Monash University, 381 Royal Parade, Parkville, VIC 3052, Australia. Electronic address: ray.norton@monash.edu."
        ]
